Fixtures for package dag.

base-3.11/conda-meta/
    The 28 conda-meta records of the micromamba-built environment
    $GOOMBA_REF_ROOT/envs/base-3.11 (conda-forge, linux-64), with the
    "files", "paths_data", "link", "extracted_package_dir" and
    "package_tarball_full_path" fields removed: they list installed files
    and local paths, which the layering test does not need.

pydagger_golden.json
    Topology computed by pydagger itself ($GOOMBA_REFS/pydagger) for every
    graph built by the generators in its tests/graph_generators.py that its
    test_optimization.py and test_benchmark.py use, plus three draws of
    CPython's random.Random(42). Descendents are sorted by (ordinal, node
    index), because pydagger's order within one ordinal follows memory
    addresses; ascendents are exactly as pydagger returns them. Written by
    pydagger_golden.py:

        python3 -I -B pydagger_golden.py "$GOOMBA_REFS/pydagger" > pydagger_golden.json

    (With no argument it uses $GOOMBA_REFS/pydagger.)
